# Do not use this example as a trust registry.
#
# After the owner explicitly approves a dedicated proof-signing public key,
# create the tracked file `lock-proof.allowed-signers` with one OpenSSH
# allowed-signers entry in this form:
#
# apptolast-terraform-lock-proof namespaces="terraform-r2-lock-proof" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... approved-lock-proof-key
